# 覆盖根 .dockerignore 的 target 整目录忽略规则，仅向快速 PR 容器上下文传递暂存二进制与测试夹具。
.git
.areal
target/*
!target/ci-container-bin
!target/ci-container-tests
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.tmp
**/.DS_Store
tests/perf/model.toml
tests/perf/**/output
clients/gui
docs
